    "description": "<p>AL-5: Deal Rep Assignments Related List</p><p>Show the Link record which reps are assigned to it, synced from the CMS, with a way to check the sync log.</p><p>FIELDS</p><p>Columns: Assignment ID, Rep, Assignment Source, Assigned (date), Status</p><p>Read-only, synced from CMS, with a &quot;View sync log&quot; link</p><p>Same list as the Deal doc&#039;s DL-8 (<a href=\"https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693636571333/f/\">BUILD-219 — Deal: Deal Rep Assignments Related List</a>), with one addition (Assignment Source) not previously documented there</p><p>IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS</p><p>Assignment Source is a new field — full option set is unknown</p><p>Not confirmed in the transcript — the prototype shows only one example value (&quot;API&quot;); not guessed at here</p><p>NOTES</p><p>Provenance: AL-5 (Affiliate Link Record User Stories doc).</p><p>Depends on the same CMS → Salesforce sync mechanism as BUILD-219 (DL-8) — no separate ticket exists for that sync itself.</p><p>SOURCE</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.nyoinaymgezg\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.nyoinaymgezg</a></p><p>Dependencies: <a href=\"https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693636693194/f/\">BUILD-220 — Affiliate Link: Link Core Fields</a>, <a href=\"https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693636571333/f/\">BUILD-219 — Deal: Deal Rep Assignments Related List</a></p><p>Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer</p><p>Created 2026-08-20 from Affiliate Link record documentation review.</p>",
