          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"518ae082ca72\">Progress so far: created the new Link lookup field on Deal Rep Assignment, added the Deal Rep Assignments related list to the Link page layout and Lightning record page. Structure confirmed working (shows correctly, just empty since no records have the new lookup populated yet).</p><p data-local-id=\"4649ab3108fb\">Blocker found while creating a test record: the Deal Rep Assignment &quot;New&quot; record layout is broken — it&#039;s missing Assignment Status, which is a required field, so records can&#039;t be saved from it at all right now. The layout also duplicates the &quot;Deal and Assignment Info&quot; section and is missing Rep (BA) entirely. This needs a page layout fix before any test or real record can be created on this object.</p><p data-local-id=\"d7dfa7bb23c7\">Still open from earlier: how the new Link lookup gets populated (CMS sync vs. manual/flow), what field represents &quot;Assigned (date)&quot; (no such field exists — closest is Effective From), and what &quot;View sync log&quot; is meant to point to (no sync log object exists in org).</p><p data-local-id=\"17501d7eac26\">Next: fix the Deal Rep Assignment page layout, then create a test record to confirm the related list columns render correctly.</p>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
